// Shared build configuration for PapaTodos.
//
// Values here are safe to commit: the Supabase publishable key is designed
// for client-side use and access control is enforced by RLS, per
// specification.md section 8.1. Never add a service-role key, APNs private
// key, or other server-only secret here.
//
// These plain build settings are read into the app's Info.plist via
// variable substitution in PapaTodos/Info.plist (Xcode's generated-Info.plist
// mode does not support arbitrary custom keys, only its own curated list).
//
// Local.xcconfig (gitignored) overrides these defaults with real values —
// copy Local.xcconfig.example to get started.

PB_SUPABASE_URL =
PB_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY =

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
